# =============================================================================
# Benchmarks
# =============================================================================
benchmarks/results/.mypycache/
benchmarks/results/.warmcache/
# Pre-run snapshots a partial run (make bench-basilisk) carries un-measured
# tools forward from. Scratch input to summarize.py, never a published record.
benchmarks/results/.carry/
# Raw per-fixture hyperfine output: ~9.6k lines rewritten on EVERY `make bench`,
# which buried real changes in diff noise. The published record of a run is
# benchmarks/status/<machine>.csv (the regression gate reads it from git) plus
# the summary.md / coverage.tsv highlights, all still tracked.
benchmarks/results/*.json


# =============================================================================
# Conformance test FIXTURES: mirrored on demand into conformance/tests/ (via
# make conformance / run_conformance.py --sync-tests) from a FRESH python/typing
# clone — never committed. The fresh clone (target/typing-upstream) and the
# harness venv (target/.conformance-venv) live under target/, already ignored above.
# =============================================================================
conformance/tests/

